 ],
 "offline_rule": "Offline layer 2 (MASTER UPDATE 1.11; build section 3): every action says what it does without a network. device: changes only this device, done at once and recorded, synced later. queue: the person confirms now, it is sealed on the device and shown as queued, carried out when the network returns, then verified and told; never shown as done before that, and it expires if the device stays offline too long. cloud_check: needs the cloud's fresh identity check, so it waits. never: needs a provider, a partner or a person, so it is not offered offline (LynkAssist prepares the case to send later; the one exception, a card freeze, is queued and shown frozen only when the issuer confirms).",
 "queue_expires_s": 604800
}
